<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico on Monday completed all three credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.628  bln pesos  7 days   29.97</p>
<p>    1.628  bln pesos  4 days   29.71</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos  1 day    29.61</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
</text>
